-- Ten project-authored HoT field missions. Apply with matching native and Lua sources.
-- Local combat profiles and equal chest weights. Period coin, Dream Motes, Dream Delvers and catalog chest items.
-- Replaces abandoned scene drafts 280 and 290. This member does not change public zone admission.
